{"seq":2,"slug":"baire-property","title":"Baire 性质：拓扑意义上的「几乎相等」","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/descriptive-set-theory/regularity/baire-property","wordCount":1542,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"baire-性质-拓扑意义上的-几乎相等\">Baire 性质：拓扑意义上的「几乎相等」</h1><p>测度论有一套「几乎处处」的语言——差一个零测集就当相等。拓扑也有一套平行的语言，只是把「零测集」换成「贫集」（meager set，可数个无处稠密集之并）。在这套语言里，一个集合若与某个开集只差一个贫集，就说它有 Baire 性质（BP）。BP 是三大正则性质中最「拓扑」的一条：它不依赖任何测度，纯粹由开集与纲畴（category）定义，却与勒贝格可测性惊人地平行。更妙的是，BP 的判定与一个具体的无穷博弈——Banach–Mazur 博弈——严丝合缝地对应，这条线索会在第四章被收成统一定理。这一篇讲清纲畴语言、BP 的定义与封闭性、Banach–Mazur 博弈，以及 BP 随复杂度爬升的成立边界。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-贫集与纲畴对偶\">核心概念：贫集与纲畴对偶</h2><p>先建立纲畴的词汇。集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> <strong>无处稠密</strong>，如果它的闭包不含任何开球（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\">‾</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\overline{A}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord overline\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8833em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8033em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"overline-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 内部为空）。集合是<strong>贫集</strong>（meager，又称第一纲）如果它是可数个无处稠密集之并；补集是贫集的集合叫<strong>余贫集</strong>（comeager）。贝尔纲定理（<a href=\"../foundations/polish-spaces\">波兰空间</a> 的完备性回报）保证：在波兰空间里，余贫集非空、且贫集不可能等于全空间——这正是让「贫」充当「可忽略」的合法性基础。</p>\n<p>一个集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 具有 <strong>Baire 性质（BP）</strong>，如果存在开集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span> 使对称差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">△</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A\\,\\triangle\\,U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">△</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span> 是贫集。直观上 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>「在贫集误差内等于一个开集」。BP 的三条基本事实使它成为一个稳健的类：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>全体有 BP 的集合构成一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span>-代数（对可数并、取补封闭）。</li>\n<li>每个 Borel 集都有 BP（开集平凡有 BP，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span>-代数封闭性递推上去）。</li>\n<li>BP 有一个「局部化」定理：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 有 BP 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 在每个非空开集上「要么贫、要么余贫」——这是判定 BP 的实用刻画。</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mtext> 有 BP</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∃</mi><mi>U</mi><mtext> 开</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>A</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">△</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>U</mi><mtext> 贫</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>V</mi><mtext> 开</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∃</mi><mi>W</mi><mo>⊆</mo><mi>V</mi><mtext> 开</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>A</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>W</mi><mtext> 或 </mtext><mi>W</mi><mo>∖</mo><mi>A</mi><mtext> 贫</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A \\text{ 有 BP} \\iff \\exists U \\text{ 开},\\ A\\,\\triangle\\,U \\text{ 贫} \\iff \\forall V\\text{ 开}\\exists W\\subseteq V\\text{ 开},\\ A\\cap W \\text{ 或 } W\\setminus A \\text{ 贫}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7073em;vertical-align:-0.024em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">有</span><span class=\"mord\"> BP</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∃</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">开</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">△</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">贫</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">开</span></span><span class=\"mord\">∃</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊆</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">开</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">或</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∖</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">贫</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;集合 A&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;A △ U 贫集&lt;br/&gt;对某开集 U?&quot;}&#10;  B --&gt;|是| C[&quot;A 有 Baire 性质&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt;|否| D[&quot;无 BP&lt;br/&gt;需选择公理构造&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; E[&quot;局部二歧:&lt;br/&gt;每个开集上 A 贫或余贫&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; F[&quot;Banach-Mazur 博弈&lt;br/&gt;判定 A 是否贫&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt; G[&quot;II 有必胜策略 ⟺ A 在该开集贫&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"集合 A\"] --&gt; B{\"A △ U 贫集&lt;br/&gt;对某开集 U?\"}\n  B --&gt;|是| C[\"A 有 Baire 性质\"]\n  B --&gt;|否| D[\"无 BP&lt;br/&gt;需选择公理构造\"]\n  C --&gt; E[\"局部二歧:&lt;br/&gt;每个开集上 A 贫或余贫\"]\n  E --&gt; F[\"Banach-Mazur 博弈&lt;br/&gt;判定 A 是否贫\"]\n  F --&gt; G[\"II 有必胜策略 ⟺ A 在该开集贫\"]</pre><h2 id=\"banach-mazur-博弈-把纲畴变成博弈\">Banach–Mazur 博弈：把纲畴变成博弈</h2><p>BP 最深刻的一面是它与博弈的对应。<strong>Banach–Mazur 博弈</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>G</mi><mrow><mo>∗</mo><mo>∗</mo></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G^{**}(A)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∗∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 这样进行：给定目标集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>⊆</mo><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A\\subseteq X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊆</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span>，两名玩家轮流选取递减的非空开集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>U</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⊇</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⊇</mo><msub><mi>U</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>⊇</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>⊇</mo><mo>⋯</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U_0\\supseteq V_0\\supseteq U_1\\supseteq V_1\\supseteq\\cdots</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊇</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊇</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊇</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊇</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.313em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">⋯</span></span></span></span></span>（I 选 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，II 选 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），直径趋于零，交出唯一一点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span>。约定：若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x\\in A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 则 II 胜，否则 I 胜。核心定理：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>II 有必胜策略</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>A</mi><mtext> 是余贫集（在所玩开集内）</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>I 有必胜策略</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>A</mi><mtext> 在某开集内贫</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{II 有必胜策略} \\iff A \\text{ 是余贫集（在所玩开集内）},\\qquad \\text{I 有必胜策略} \\iff A \\text{ 在某开集内贫}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7073em;vertical-align:-0.024em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">II </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">有必胜策略</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">是余贫集（在所玩开集内）</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">I </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">有必胜策略</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">在某开集内贫</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这条定理把「纲畴」完全翻译成「博弈胜负」。它的威力在于：如果某类集合的 Banach–Mazur 博弈总被决定（总有一方有必胜策略），那么这类集合就都有 BP。于是 BP 的成立性被归结为博弈的决定性——这正是 <a href=\"../practice/determinacy\">决定性</a> 一章「决定性 ⟹ 正则性质」链条的又一具体实例，与完美集博弈、协变博弈并列。</p>\n<h2 id=\"随复杂度的成立边界\">随复杂度的成立边界</h2><p>BP 和完美集性质一样，随复杂度爬升逐级失效，边界略有不同。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>复杂度层</th>\n<th>是否有 BP</th>\n<th>依据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Borel <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Δ</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{\\Delta}^1_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1371em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">Δ</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8901em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.139em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span>-代数封闭性（ZFC）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>解析 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Σ</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{\\Sigma}^1_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1371em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">Σ</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8901em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.139em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>Nikodym / Lusin–Sierpiński（ZFC）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>余解析 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Π</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{\\Pi}^1_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1371em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">Π</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8901em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.139em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>补集封闭（ZFC）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Σ</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{\\Sigma}^1_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1371em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">Σ</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8901em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.139em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>独立于 ZFC</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 中有反例；一个不可达基数即保证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全投影层级</td>\n<td>独立</td>\n<td>需 PD / 无穷多 Woodin 基数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>值得注意，BP 比 PSP 「便宜」一点：解析集和余解析集在 ZFC 内都有 BP（PSP 在余解析层就已独立）。原因在于 BP 的证明只需苏斯林运算对「贫近似」封闭，而不需要 PSP 所依赖的完美子树。这个细微差异说明三大性质虽然常同进退，却各有自己的复杂度上限，并非严格捆绑——它们的独立性正是 <a href=\"measurability\">勒贝格可测性</a> 一篇会进一步对照的主题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一个不可测却有-bp-的世界\">一个不可测却有 BP 的世界</h2><p>BP 与可测性的独立性可以极端化。存在（在合适模型中）<strong>有 BP 却不可测的集合</strong>，也存在<strong>可测却无 BP 的集合</strong>：两条性质逻辑上互不蕴含。更戏剧的是全局图景——通过强制法，可以造出「所有集合都有 BP」的模型（Shelah 无需任何大基数就实现了这一点，这与「所有集合可测」需要一个不可达基数形成鲜明对比）。这个不对称是描述集合论一个精细而重要的事实：纲畴的正则性比测度的正则性「一致性强度更低」。</p>\n<p>Shelah 的这个结果（1984）至今是分界大基数强度的经典标尺：它告诉我们「拓扑规矩」和「测度规矩」虽然表面孪生，深层的公理成本却不同。BP 因此常被当作研究正则性质时「最温和」的探针——很多定理先在 BP 上验证，再费更大力气推广到可测性。三条性质的这种强度谱系，是理解为什么第四章要引入决定性作为「统一而昂贵」的来源的关键背景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>纲畴语言：无处稠密 → 贫集（可数并）→ 余贫集；贝尔纲定理让「贫」充当拓扑意义的「可忽略」。</li>\n<li>Baire 性质：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">△</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A\\,\\triangle\\,U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">△</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span> 贫（对某开集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span>）；全体有 BP 的集合是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span>-代数，含全部 Borel 集；有「每个开集上贫或余贫」的局部刻画。</li>\n<li>Banach–Mazur 博弈把纲畴翻译成胜负：II 必胜 ⟺ 余贫，I 必胜 ⟺ 贫；博弈决定性 ⟹ BP。</li>\n<li>解析与余解析集在 ZFC 内即有 BP（比 PSP 便宜）；更高层独立。Shelah 证「万物有 BP」无需大基数，而「万物可测」需不可达基数——纲畴比测度一致性强度更低。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章邻篇：<a href=\"perfect-set-property\">完美集性质</a>（基数侧）与 <a href=\"measurability\">勒贝格可测性</a>（测度侧）—— 三性质的强度对照。</li>\n<li>BP 的博弈判定如何被统一：<a href=\"../practice/determinacy\">决定性</a>。</li>\n<li>无处稠密、稠密、闭包等拓扑基础：<a href=\"../../topology-intro/topological-spaces/open-closed-sets-topology-definition\">拓扑学入门 · 开闭集与拓扑定义</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Baire 性质：拓扑意义上的「几乎相等」","id":"baire-性质-拓扑意义上的-几乎相等"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：贫集与纲畴对偶","id":"核心概念-贫集与纲畴对偶"},{"level":2,"text":"Banach–Mazur 博弈：把纲畴变成博弈","id":"banach-mazur-博弈-把纲畴变成博弈"},{"level":2,"text":"随复杂度的成立边界","id":"随复杂度的成立边界"},{"level":2,"text":"一个不可测却有 BP 的世界","id":"一个不可测却有-bp-的世界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"完美集性质：连续统假设的可定义版本","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/descriptive-set-theory/regularity/perfect-set-property"},"next":{"title":"勒贝格可测性：可定义就不会失去测度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/descriptive-set-theory/regularity/measurability"}}